<title>FRANCE: Templeton fund has 5.2 pct of Scor.</title>
<headline>Templeton fund has 5.2 pct of Scor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment fund Templeton Global Investors Inc has disclosed that it holds 1.4 million shares in French reinsurer Scor, or 5.2 percent of the total outstanding, bourse regulator CMF (Conseil des Marches Financiers) said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
